# …except this one. The playground is a fixture in this repository, not
# somebody's application: its APP_KEY and AUTH_SECRET are placeholders, and
# `bun test` cannot pass without it — a fresh clone runs against an empty
# database and fails eight tests with no hint as to why. A scaffolded app keeps
# ignoring its own `.env`, which is why the template still does.
!.env
